@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 20

actor Client as "Cliente / Dispositivo IoT"
participant Gateway as "Gateway Service\n(clinical-alerts-gateway)" #lightblue
participant GController as "TelemetryController" #lightblue
participant GService as "TelemetryGatewayService" #lightblue
participant WebClient as "TelemetryIngestionClient\n(WebClient)" #lightblue
participant Ingestion as "Ingestion Service\n(clinical-alerts-ingestion)" #lightgreen
participant IController as "TelemetryController" #lightgreen
participant IService as "TelemetryService" #lightgreen
database DB as "Banco de Dados\n(PostgreSQL)" #orange
queue Kafka as "Kafka" #darkorange
participant Consumer as "Telemetry Consumer\n(@KafkaListener)" #lightgreen

== Fluxo de Telemetria ==

Client -> Gateway: POST /api/telemetry/raw
Gateway -> GController: receiveRaw(TelemetryRaw)
GController -> GService: sendTelemetry(raw)

note right of GService
  @Async + Validation + Mapper
end note

GService -> WebClient: sendTelemetry(TelemetryDTO)
WebClient -> Ingestion: POST /api/telemetry
note right of WebClient: HTTP Reactive (WebClient)

Ingestion -> IController: receive(TelemetryDTO)
IController -> IService: received(dto)

IService -> IService: validate + toEntity()
IService -> DB: repository.save()
DB --> IService: Telemetry salve

IService -> Kafka: publish(TelemetryReceivedEvent)
Kafka --> IService: Ack

IService --> IController: 202 Accepted
IController --> WebClient: 202 Accepted
WebClient --> GService: Sucess
GService --> GController: CompletableFuture completed
GController --> Client: 202 Accepted

== Processamento Assíncrono ==

Kafka -> Consumer: Consomme telemetry-topic
Consumer -> Consumer: Business logic\n(Alerts, etc.)
@enduml